== Note ==
<ul>
<li>This Quest may be multiquested, need confirmation of this.</li>
<li>[[Kalayia Woodwhisper]] is an incredibly rare spawn on live, but may be more common here. Her page includes a map of her location. She's a level 22(ish) druid and has no faction hits.</li>
<li>[[Obretl]] is a level 22(ish) skeleton necro who is a rare spawn in the mostly-buried tower in South Ro. While killing placeholders you'll likely get the embalming dust and zombie skin.</li>
</ul>

